{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>朱古力脆粒夾心!忌廉香滑冰涼</p><p>西樹泡芙新推薄荷朱古力泡芙</p><p>西樹泡芙今個8月新推出薄荷朱古力泡芙，外層酥脆的黑朱古力曲奇，內餡是綿密香滑的薄荷朱古力忌廉、朱古力脆粒夾心，口感層次豐富，每啖都是薄荷朱古力的清涼味道，夏日食特別爽！</p><p>西樹泡芙 官方IG：@chezchoux</p><p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178694646476398663_11772275116a82a3a11845a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178694646677534123_798123276a82a3a3b9beb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178694646968523945_3954688796a82a3a630584.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17869464718464096_4526820876a82a3a85a944.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178694647394793320_19918135846a82a3aa6a0e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T06:05:27.320482+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}